    "turn_text": "to talk about dates and when people were born We're here to talk about your US Senate bid. We're very excited to have him in the studio today. But the first question I think we got to ask and got to get out of the way right away. The last time you were on this show, I asked you very directly, would you swear off running for any other office? And you said that your sole focus was becoming attorney general and that was the only job you wanted to do. I'm patting myself on the back for being so foresighted on that.",
