    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86579.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 30,
    "turn_text": "I know you've been asked this question before, but why did you decide to run for US Senate when in your 2016 campaign, you criticized your opponents for trying to climb the political ladder?",
