    "turn_text": "Now, you mentioned about Kevin Anna, he has already attracted some controversy, I'm just kind of laying this out here. A, there's been some polls that have come out that say that the majority of Americans actually would prefer that the Roe v. Wade decision that in 1973 that legalized most abortions should stand. There's been some controversy about other things from his ball tickets. I mean, just what's your thoughts about how you think he would rule and how he would fit in with what you see as the chief aim.",
