    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86579.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 53,
    "turn_text": "Now, you're talking about the 20-week ban. Now, there's been some controversy. I'm not advocating one way or the other, but just trying to lay out some of the controversies here. There has been some controversies, A, about whether or not that's accurate, as far as the pain, but that B, that actually some of it is to prevent, while most abortions are actually in the first 12 weeks or so, but is to prevent some late-term ones that are for physical disabilities or other problems that are found in utero. How do you see that? I mean, because some say it's not really about the pain, it's about blocking down syndrome, abortions, that sort of thing.",
