    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86579.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 55,
    "turn_text": "Now, you mentioned immigration. Missouri does not have as much immigration from Mexico and some of the southern countries as some other states. But how would you deal with this on a national level if you're in the US Senate? There has been debate over whether or not the wall helps, the separation of children from their parents, all that. How would you deal with",
