    "turn_text": "fire away. Well, look, I mean, as it relates to the hacking or attempted hacking, I can't say that I'm surprised. I mean, Russia is a bad actor, and they have been attempting to interfere in our democracy and our economy for years now. We can't let them do it. We haven't let them do it in the past, and we can't let them do it now. So, you know, I think that that's the bottom line on this. Again, Secretary of State Mike Pompeo said just the other day, he captured this, I think, really well, where he said, look, you know, the Russians have got, we have got to show them strength. We have got to, we've got to show them that it can be in their interests to cooperate with us and to adhere to democratic norms and international norms. And so we've got to hold open that prospect, but we cannot allow their meddling in their attempts to influence our way of life, our democracy to go forward.",
