    "turn_text": "Now, I want to shift back to the hacking just for a minute. The way they did it was pretending to be a Microsoft site asking you to update stuff. Are you concerned at all that actually your office or your campaign might be running into this? Have there been some protections or cautions that you guys have been dealing with? Because there's no guarantee that they wouldn't do it against you too.",
